---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Preparation Guide | Bodhi Gaya Retreat">
    <section class="max-w-4xl py-16 space-y-10">
        <div>
            <p class="mb-3 text-sm uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-neutral-500">Preparation Guide</p>
            <h1 class="mb-6">Information to Prepare for the Trip</h1>
            <p class="max-w-3xl text-lg leading-8 text-neutral-700">
                Please complete the preparation steps below for the trip and send the information to the organizing team once available. This helps the team
                keep track of all retreat participants and their travel details. In your reply, please clearly include any information related to flights,
                accommodation, visas, and travel documents.
            </p>
        </div>

        <div class="grid gap-6">
            <div class="rounded-2xl border border-neutral-200 bg-white p-6 md:p-8">
                <p class="mb-3 text-sm uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-neutral-500">Steps to Complete</p>
                <h2 class="mb-6">Information to Send to the Organizing Team</h2>

                <div class="space-y-6 text-neutral-700">
                    <div class="rounded-2xl border border-neutral-200 bg-neutral-50 p-5">
                        <h3 class="mb-3 text-xl font-semibold text-neutral-900">1. Book Your Flight to India</h3>
                        <p class="leading-8">Arrival airport: <strong>Gaya (GAY)</strong></p>
                        <p class="mt-4 leading-8">The usual route is to arrive in Delhi first, then continue onward to Gaya.</p>
                        <p class="mt-3 leading-8">Please send the organizing team:</p>
                        <ul class="mt-2 list-disc space-y-2 pl-6 leading-8">
                            <li>Your flight booking confirmation</li>
                            <li>Flight number and arrival time</li>
                        </ul>
                    </div>

                    <div class="rounded-2xl border border-neutral-200 bg-neutral-50 p-5">
                        <h3 class="mb-3 text-xl font-semibold text-neutral-900">2. Arrange Accommodation in Bodh Gaya</h3>
                        <p class="leading-8">Please send us:</p>
                        <ul class="mt-2 list-disc space-y-2 pl-6 leading-8">
                            <li>Your hotel booking confirmation</li>
                        </ul>
                        <p class="mt-4 leading-8">Please see the suggested accommodation list below.</p>
                    </div>

                    <div class="rounded-2xl border border-neutral-200 bg-neutral-50 p-5">
                        <h3 class="mb-3 text-xl font-semibold text-neutral-900">3. Apply for an Indian Visa</h3>
                        <p class="leading-8">Please send us:</p>
                        <ul class="mt-2 list-disc space-y-2 pl-6 leading-8">
                            <li>A copy of your visa once it has been issued</li>
                        </ul>
                        <div class="mt-4 rounded-xl border border-neutral-200 bg-white p-4">
                            <p class="font-medium text-neutral-900">Indian e-Visa Guidance</p>
                            <ul class="mt-3 list-disc space-y-3 pl-6 leading-8">
                                <li>
                                    Submit your e-visa application through the
                                    <a
                                        href="https://indianvisaonline.gov.in/evisa/"
                                        target="_blank"
                                        rel="noreferrer"
                                        class="font-medium text-neutral-900 underline underline-offset-4"
                                    >
                                        official Indian e-visa portal
                                    </a>
                                    .
                                </li>
                                <li>
                                    View the visa fee schedule in the
                                    <a
                                        href="https://www.indianvisaonline.gov.in/evisa/images/Etourist_fee_final.pdf"
                                        target="_blank"
                                        rel="noreferrer"
                                        class="font-medium text-neutral-900 underline underline-offset-4"
                                    >
                                        official e-tourist visa fee document
                                    </a>
                                    .
                                </li>
                                <li>
                                    At the moment, the system only allows you to select an expected arrival date up to August. The organizing team will send a
                                    reminder again at the end of August, together with more detailed visa instructions.
                                </li>
                                <li>Visa processing usually takes about 72 hours, provided there are no issues or requests for additional documents.</li>
                            </ul>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="rounded-2xl border border-neutral-200 bg-neutral-50 p-5">
                        <h3 class="mb-3 text-xl font-semibold text-neutral-900">4. Prepare Your Travel Documents</h3>
                        <p class="leading-8">Please send us:</p>
                        <ul class="mt-2 list-disc space-y-2 pl-6 leading-8">
                            <li>A scanned copy of your passport photo page</li>
                            <li>Travel insurance confirmation, if available</li>
                        </ul>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <p class="mt-6 leading-8 text-neutral-700">
                    In general, please send the organizing team all travel-related documents as soon as they are available, so we can keep complete records of
                    everyone’s travel arrangements.
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="rounded-2xl border border-neutral-200 bg-neutral-50 p-6 md:p-8">
                <p class="mb-3 text-sm uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-neutral-500">Packing</p>
                <h2 class="mb-4">Recommended Items to Bring</h2>
                <p class="leading-8 text-neutral-700">The following items are recommended for the retreat:</p>
                <ul class="mt-4 list-disc space-y-3 pl-6 leading-8 text-neutral-700">
                    <li>A shawl or light jacket, as early mornings and evenings may be cool</li>
                    <li>Personal medications</li>
                    <li>A reusable water bottle</li>
                    <li>Sunscreen and a hat</li>
                    <li>A small flashlight</li>
                    <li>A notebook for Dharma reflections</li>
                    <li>Copies of your passport and visa</li>
                </ul>

                <h3 class="mt-8 mb-3 text-xl font-semibold text-neutral-900">Optional but Helpful</h3>
                <ul class="list-disc space-y-3 pl-6 leading-8 text-neutral-700">
                    <li>Earplugs</li>
                    <li>Comfortable sandals or walking shoes</li>
                </ul>
            </div>

            <div class="rounded-2xl border border-neutral-200 bg-neutral-50 p-6 md:p-8">
                <p class="mb-3 text-sm uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-neutral-500">Important Notes</p>
                <h2 class="mb-4">Things to Keep in Mind</h2>
                <ul class="list-disc space-y-3 pl-6 leading-8 text-neutral-700">
                    <li>Please maintain mindfulness and a respectful attitude at all sacred sites.</li>
                    <li>Please wear modest and appropriate clothing when visiting temples and shrines.</li>
                    <li>Drink only bottled or properly filtered water.</li>
                    <li>Traffic in India can be quite chaotic, so please allow extra time for travel.</li>
                    <li>The retreat schedule may begin very early in the morning.</li>
                </ul>
            </div>

            <div class="rounded-2xl border border-neutral-200 bg-neutral-50 p-6 md:p-8">
                <p class="mb-3 text-sm uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-neutral-500">Accommodation Suggestions</p>
                <h2 class="mb-4">Suggested Places to Stay in Bodh Gaya</h2>
                <p class="leading-8 text-neutral-700">Participants arrange their own accommodation. Below are several suggested places to stay.</p>
                <p class="mt-4 leading-8 text-neutral-700">
                    To get better room rates at hotels in Bodh Gaya, you can contact the phone numbers listed on Google Maps directly through WhatsApp. This
                    often results in a lower price. You may also book through third-party platforms such as <strong>Booking.com</strong>, <strong
                        >Hostelworld</strong
                    >,
                    <strong>Airbnb</strong>, and similar services.
                </p>

                <div class="mt-6 grid gap-4 md:grid-cols-2">
                    <div class="rounded-2xl border border-neutral-200 bg-white p-5">
                        <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-neutral-900">Zenn Inn</h3>
                        <p class="mt-3 leading-8 text-neutral-700">Near the Vietnamese temple area, Bodh Gaya</p>
                        <a
                            href="https://maps.google.com/?q=Zenn+Inn+Bodh+Gaya"
                            target="_blank"
                            rel="noreferrer"
                            class="mt-4 inline-flex font-medium text-neutral-900 underline underline-offset-4"
                        >
                            View on Google Maps
                        </a>
                    </div>

                    <div class="rounded-2xl border border-neutral-200 bg-white p-5">
                        <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-neutral-900">Lien Duc Hotel</h3>
                        <p class="mt-3 leading-8 text-neutral-700">Near the Vietnamese temple, Bodh Gaya</p>
                        <a
                            href="https://maps.google.com/?q=Lien+Duc+Hotel+Bodh+Gaya"
                            target="_blank"
                            rel="noreferrer"
                            class="mt-4 inline-flex font-medium text-neutral-900 underline underline-offset-4"
                        >
                            View on Google Maps
                        </a>
                    </div>

                    <div class="rounded-2xl border border-neutral-200 bg-white p-5">
                        <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-neutral-900">OM Hotel</h3>
                        <a
                            href="https://maps.app.goo.gl/5GuAGwEeUuuRqFEL9?g_st=iw"
                            target="_blank"
                            rel="noreferrer"
                            class="mt-4 inline-flex font-medium text-neutral-900 underline underline-offset-4"
                        >
                            View on Google Maps
                        </a>
                    </div>

                    <div class="rounded-2xl border border-neutral-200 bg-white p-5">
                        <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-neutral-900">GM Hotel</h3>
                        <a
                            href="https://maps.app.goo.gl/6ZHaJkteeQ3WjbWw5?g_st=iw"
                            target="_blank"
                            rel="noreferrer"
                            class="mt-4 inline-flex font-medium text-neutral-900 underline underline-offset-4"
                        >
                            View on Google Maps
                        </a>
                    </div>

                    <div class="rounded-2xl border border-neutral-200 bg-white p-5 md:col-span-2">
                        <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-neutral-900">Vien Giac Buddhist Practice Center</h3>
                        <p class="mt-3 leading-8 text-neutral-700">
                            The room rate at Vien Giac Buddhist Practice Center is <strong>1,000 rupees per room for 2 people</strong>.
                        </p>
                        <p class="mt-3 leading-8 text-neutral-700">
                            To book a room at Vien Giac Center, you may fill out this form before 01/06/2026:
                            <a
                                href="https://forms.gle/iTAkNnSLm3NcqE5R9"
                                target="_blank"
                                rel="noreferrer"
                                class="font-medium text-neutral-900 underline underline-offset-4"
                            >
                                https://forms.gle/iTAkNnSLm3NcqE5R9
                            </a>
                            . We will help contact the center on your behalf.
                        </p>
                        <p class="mt-3 leading-8 text-neutral-700">
                            Please note that Vien Giac Center has not been maintained for a long time, so some areas have deteriorated and the quality may not
                            be comparable to a hotel. Nun Tue Dam Huong is currently carrying out repairs and maintenance, and we hope conditions will improve
                            by the end of the year.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="rounded-2xl border border-neutral-200 bg-white p-6 md:p-8">
                <h2 class="mb-4">Contact the Organizing Team</h2>
                <p class="leading-8 text-neutral-700">
                    If you have any questions or need assistance related to travel, accommodation, or preparing for the retreat, please contact the organizing
                    team.
                </p>
                <div class="mt-6 rounded-2xl border-2 border-emerald-500 bg-emerald-50 p-6">
                    <p class="mb-2 text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-emerald-700">Stay Connected</p>
                    <h3 class="mb-3 text-2xl font-bold text-neutral-900">Join the Retreat WhatsApp Community</h3>
                    <p class="leading-8 text-neutral-700">
                        This is our main channel for announcements, reminders, and questions before and during the retreat. We strongly encourage every
                        participant to join so you never miss an important update.
                    </p>
                    <a
                        href="https://chat.whatsapp.com/JP8L50ijm2xF4qOKVB23Zr"
                        target="_blank"
                        rel="noreferrer"
                        class="btn btn-lg mt-5 bg-emerald-600 text-white hover:opacity-90"
                    >
                        Join the WhatsApp Community
                    </a>
                </div>
                <p class="mt-4 leading-8 text-neutral-700">We wish you the best possible preparation for the retreat in Bodh Gaya.</p>
                <p class="mt-6 leading-8 text-neutral-700">
                    With gratitude,<br />
                    The Organizing Team
                </p>
                <div class="mt-6 grid gap-3 text-neutral-700 md:grid-cols-2">
                    <div class="rounded-xl border border-neutral-200 bg-neutral-50 px-4 py-3">To Dinh Vien Giac</div>
                    <div class="rounded-xl border border-neutral-200 bg-neutral-50 px-4 py-3">Amitayus Monastery</div>
                    <div class="rounded-xl border border-neutral-200 bg-neutral-50 px-4 py-3">Lien Tam Monastery</div>
                    <div class="rounded-xl border border-neutral-200 bg-neutral-50 px-4 py-3">Vien Lac Monastery</div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>
</Layout>
